**Finding:** BBN Delta N_eff 95% limit is Delta N_eff <0.55 (Delta chi2 vs SM >3.84) using server baselines Yp=0.2449±0.004 and D/H=2.547±0.025e-5 (Aver et al. 2021, Cooke et al. 2018) with slopes dYp/dN_eff=0.0135 and dD/H/dN_eff=0.33e-5; a fully thermalized sterile (N_eff=4.044) predicts Yp=0.2596 and D/H=2.777e-5, 3.7 sigma above Yp; server SF Delta N_eff is heuristic 0.1x DW capped at L<=0.1 and cannot test L>0.5 where analytic xi_e shift dYp/dxi_e ~ -0.25 can compensate Delta N_eff ~0.5-1.0.
