[finding] f-122 Structure-formation bounds 2024-2026: thermal-relic m_th >6.5 keV (MW satellites DES+PS1, Nadler et al 2024), >6.1 keV (strong lensing, 2024), and Lyman-alpha m
**Finding:** Structure-formation bounds 2024-2026: thermal-relic m_th >6.5 keV (MW satellites DES+PS1, Nadler et al 2024), >6.1 keV (strong lensing, 2024), and Lyman-alpha m_th ~5-5.7 keV; via Viel+2005 DW mapping m_s=4.43 keV*(m_th/keV)^{4/3} this requires DW sterile mass m_s >53.7 keV (satellites), >49 keV (lensing), >29-41 keV (Lyman-alpha 4.1-5.3 keV), consistent with d-06 DW exclusion >28-48 keV (Lyα) and >76 keV (satellites 8.4-8.5 keV); SF resonant and inflaton-decay production are colder (lower <p>/T) so same m_s corresponds to larger effective m_th and bounds shift down by factor ~1.5-3, reopening m_s~10-20 keV at small mixing.
[tool] tc-261102_1-w1-d-24-74 -> ok: Recorded finding f-122.
