**Blocked — Literature robustness check: verify 2024-2026 structure-formation (Lyman-alpha, satellite counts, lensing) bounds on m_th and their translation to m_s for each production mechanism..** (Tool budget (5 calls) exhausted before read_arxiv_chunk/cite/get_paper_figures could be executed; web_search DNS failures prevented arXiv ID resolution for verbatim quotes. Dead end x-29 recorded.) d-24 partial: Established structure-formation m_th bounds from 2024-2026 snippets: MW satellites DES+PS1 m_th>6.5 keV (Nadler et al 2024), strong lensing m_th>6.1 keV (strongest lensing to date, 2024), Lyman-alpha m_th~5-5.7 keV (HIRES/UVES z=4.2-5.0). Via Viel+2005 DW mapping m_s=4.43 keV*(m_th/keV)^{4/3} this implies DW m_s>53.7 keV (satellites), >49 keV (lensing), >29-41 keV (Lyα 4.1-5.3 keV), consistent with d-06 DW needs m_s>28-48 keV (Lyα) and >76 keV (satellites 8.4-8.5 keV) leaving no DW window when combined with X-ray limits. Server baselines confirmed: Yp=0.2449±0.004, D/H=2.547±0.025e-5, N_eff_CMB=2.99±0.17, BBN fit valid N_eff 2.044-6.044, exclusion Delta chi2>3.84. DW grid 5-70 keV x sin^2 2theta 1e-12 to 1e-10 (21 pts) saved to /Users/nramachandra/hep-genesis-testing/projects/ramp-research-sterile-bbn-xray/runs/261102_173925/sterile_nu_grid_DW_9e26a8.csv: Delta N_eff 4.7e-06 to 0.0039, 0/21 BBN-excluded, 7/21 overclose (e.g. 10 keV/1e-10 Omega_s h2=0.087, 50 keV/1e-11 Omega_s h2=0.158). Mechanism caveat posted: Viel mapping DW-specific; SF resonant and inflaton-decay are colder (<p>/T lower ~1.5-3x) so same m_s = larger effective m_th, reopening m_s~10-20 keV at sin^2 2theta<1e-12. Findings f-122 to f-125 posted. Remaining open: 2-3 verbatim m_th quotes with arXiv IDs/citations, get_paper_figures, and formal per-mechanism viability table with provenance column (DNS failures blocked arXiv resolution; tool budget exhausted).
